Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes the force-install policy — useless on a non-managed machine
; (Chromium only auto-installs Web Store extensions unless enterprise managed).
; Double-click, accept UAC.

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Chromium\ExtensionInstallForcelist]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Policies\Helium\ExtensionInstallForcelist]
